	(text "Place here (follow RTL8153B reference design from Realtek AppNote):\n  • U2: RTL8153B-VC-CG — USB 3.0 device + Gigabit PHY + MAC (QFN-64)\n  • U3: 93LC46BT-I/OT — 1 Kbit MicroWire EEPROM (see firmware/eeprom-image.md)\n        SCS/SCK/SI/SO → RTL8153B EECS/EECLK/EEDI/EEDO\n        Add 4 test points on SCS, SCK, SI, SO for in-circuit programming\n  • Y1: 25 MHz ±25 ppm crystal (5×3.2 mm)\n        Place under RTL8153B XTAL pins; GND guard ring; no traces underneath\n  • C20, C21: 18 pF NP0 0402 — crystal load caps (verify against crystal datasheet CL)\n  • C22–C40: 100 nF X7R 0402 — one per RTL8153B power pin (~15 total)\n  • C41–C44: 10 µF X5R 0603 — bulk decoupling at each power domain\n  • R20–R25: strap / bias resistors per RTL8153B reference design\n  • LED1: green 0603 — LINK indicator (RTL8153B LED0 pin → LED_LINK → Sheet 01)\n  • LED2: yellow 0603 — ACT indicator (RTL8153B LED1 pin → LED_ACT → Sheet 01)\n        Note: current-limiting resistors R101/R102 are on Sheet 01 near the RJ45 jack\n  • SW1: SMD tact switch — RST_N pull-down to GND (reset button)\n\nRTL8153B power domains:\n  VDD33 pins → +3V3 (I/O ring, from Sheet 03)\n  VDD10 pins → +1V0 (core, from Sheet 03)\n  VBUS pin   → +5V  (USB VBUS sense input — not a power source here, sense only)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 22.86 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000001001")
	)

