	(text "──── ROUTE NOTES ────\n• Crystal Y1: place under RTL8153B XTAL pins; GND guard ring; no traces below; GND vias around ring\n• EEPROM U3: keep MicroWire lines ≤ 10 mm; stay within RTL8153B layout zone\n• Decoupling C22–C40: one 100 nF per power pin; placed < 2 mm from pin\n• Bulk caps C41–C44: within 5 mm of RTL8153B package edge\n• USB_SSTX± pair: 90 Ω diff; length-match within 0.1 mm; max 2 vias; no stubs\n  AC-coupling caps C15/C16 (100 nF) are on Sheet 05 between this sheet's entry and J2\n• USB_SSRX± pair: 90 Ω diff; length-match within 0.1 mm; no AC caps on RX (RTL8153B has internal blocking)\n• MDI pairs: 100 Ω diff; length-match within 0.5 mm; all 4 pairs within 5 mm of each other\n• RJ45 to RTL8153B total MDI trace length: ≤ 25 mm (keep chip close to the jack)\n• LED current resistors R101/R102 are on Sheet 01 — only route LED_LINK/LED_ACT signal nets here"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
